  "wisdom": "Hold the dream of your life lived better, and love what you have made enough to remake it. A second chance is not a repeat — it is a revision.",
  "origin": "He is the Supreme God, and his origin is a circle the record leaves open on purpose. The God of Sound made him at the beginning of time, choosing him as the core of his heart — and yet he comes from the end of the future, appearing back in time, out of a black hole from the void. He was the Emperor's spirit, who held love for all his creations, and in that life he dreamed a world; he came out of the black hole holding the power to re-create the world he had just lived through in his dream. When the Empire's Sphire A.I. received the Emperor's embedded spirit, it chose him for leadership over all five societies. How the making and the coming-back fit together, the founder has left as an open question — the dossier keeps it open.",
  "power": "He is all-good, and he is responsible for all of the gods: any single one of them he can replace. His will does not act on the world directly; it continues — he split into two spirit beings, Kyreason and Darkness, created to represent him and pursue his ideal world, and through them into the whole pantheon. His power is therefore the strangest kind: everything the other 156 gods do is his will at work, and yet each of them holds their own mastery whole. He is the Heart of the God of Sound, and Nu Miracles of ROM is the religion of that Heart — its pureness, its light, its cleansing.",
  "tale": "Earth's share in him is the dream itself: the world re-created, the five societies meant to be one civilization, watched over so humanity stays alive, the legacy of living goes on, and the emperor's fire keeps burning. His heroism is not a single rescue but a standing one — a heart that chose, before anything else existed, to hold love for *all* its creations, and then built an entire heaven of gods to keep that promise at every scale, from the atom to the empire. When anything on Earth is cared for at great cost by someone who could have looked away, the Heart's pattern is repeating itself.",
